  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.41 Continuous coater",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.41 \"Continuous coater\" means a finishing system that continuously applies finishing materials onto furniture or burial casket parts moving along a conveyor system, wherein finishing materials that are not transferred to the parts are recycled to the finishing reservoir.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
